<title>USA: Juneau, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Juneau, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird said it won $1.810 million of Juneau, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.5545 percent.</p>
</text>
